#. type: Plain text
#: docs/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Type | Meaning |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `printer` | string |  |\n"
"| `host` | string |  |\n"
"| `name` | string | Its name in `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `model` | string |  |\n"
"| `state` | string |  |\n"
"| `error` | null or Warning |  |\n"
"| `dpi` | number |  |\n"
"| `firmware` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `modes` | array of string |  |\n"
"| `media` | object | What is loaded and how the printer is set up, as far as it tells (null: not told): tape_mm, remaining_mm, total_mm, pitch_mm (die-cut labels: the label distance measured), width_mm (the print width set on a ZPL printer: a setting, not the loaded labels), print_method (direct or transfer, as set on the printer), media_type (gap, mark or continuous: how the printer is set to find the labels), cassette. Not told by the printer but from the server's settings for it: job_print_method and job_media_type, what this server's jobs do. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| الحقل | النوع | المعنى |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `printer` | string |  |\n"
"| `host` | string |  |\n"
"| `name` | string | اسمها في `printers.toml`. |\n"
"| `model` | string |  |\n"
"| `state` | string |  |\n"
"| `error` | null or Warning |  |\n"
"| `dpi` | number |  |\n"
"| `firmware` | string or null |  |\n"
"| `modes` | array of string |  |\n"
"| `media` | object | ما هو محمّل وكيف أُعدّت الطابعة، بقدر ما تخبر (null: لم تخبر): tape_mm وremaining_mm وtotal_mm وpitch_mm (للملصقات المقصوصة: مسافة الملصقات المقاسة) وwidth_mm (عرض الطباعة المضبوط على طابعة ZPL: إعداد لا الملصقات المحمّلة) وprint_method (direct أو transfer، كما هو مضبوط على الطابعة) وmedia_type (gap أو mark أو continuous: كيف أُعدّت الطابعة للعثور على الملصقات) وcassette. لا تخبر بها الطابعة بل تأتي من إعدادات الخادم لها: job_print_method وjob_media_type، أي ما تفعله مهام هذا الخادم. |\n"

